## Path:        System/Logging
## Description: go-syslog UDP syslog collector
## Type:        string
## Default:     ""
#
# Extra command line flags for go-syslog. Run "go-syslog -h" for all flags.
# Defaults: -listen :514 -dir /var/log/go-syslog -retention 168h
# Example:  GO_SYSLOG_ARGS="-listen 0.0.0.0:514 -retention 72h -writers 8"
# Docker:   GO_SYSLOG_ARGS="-split-by-tag 127.0.0.1" writes <ip>/<container>/
#           files for the senders listed (see README, "Docker containers").
#
# Note: if you change -dir, also allow writing there:
#   systemctl edit go-syslog   ->   [Service] ReadWritePaths=/new/dir
GO_SYSLOG_ARGS=""
